nd NFL star quarterback, had been coaching high school football for six years.","published":"2026-11-19T12:19:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50514617/philip-rivers-nc-state-fairhope-alabama","type":"Story","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Week 12 Game Day Kickoff: Appreciating Jeremiah Smith's greatness","description":"What to expect in Week 12, from top games and players to teams on upset alert.","published":"2026-11-19T17:08:28.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/page/gamedaykickoff111926/week-12-top-games-upsets-preview","type":"Story","byline":"David Hale","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4867887/terrance-carter-jr","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr."},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Terrance Carter Jr.","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Terrance_Carter_Jr.","description":"American football tight end","touched":"2026-11-14T07:36:56Z","intro":"Terrance Carter Jr. is an American college football tight end for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He previously played for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Carter Jr. attended Harker Heights High School in Harker Heights, Texas, and committed to play college football for the Louisiana Ragin' Cajuns over Arkansas State."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"LOUISIANA\nAs a freshman in 2022, Carter Jr. took a redshirt. In 2023, he hauled in 28 receptions for 255 yards and three touchdowns. In week 8 of the 2024 season, Carter Jr. made seven catches for 149 yards and a touchdown in a 34-24 victory over Coastal Carolina. During the 2024 season, he recorded 48 catches for 689 yards and four touchdowns. After the 2024 season, Carter Jr. entered his name into the NCAA transfer portal.\n\nTEXAS TECH\nCarter Jr. transferred to play for the Texas Tech Red Raiders. He is expected to be the Red Raider's starting tight end."}]}}